1526
01:58:01.405 --> 01:58:02.536
Kau punya waktu tiga jam.

1527
01:58:48.078 --> 01:58:50.155
<i>Gerakan mata terdeteksi.</i>

1528
01:58:51.587 --> 01:58:53.356
<i>Selamat pagi, Dr. Grace.</i>

1529
