bagian Taumoeba milikmu
ke Erid.

1564
02:04:34.358 --> 02:04:35.632
Jadi

1565
02:04:36.294 --> 02:04:38.327
Tidak ada tekanan

1566
02:04:38.862 --> 02:04:41.473
tapi kita sudah sepakat.

1567
02:06:01.445 --> 02:06:02.918
Sst.

1568
02:06:02.919 --> 02:06:04.314
Grace?

1569
02:06:09.827 --> 02:06:12.191
Rock, bisa kau

1570
