02:07:01.681 --> 02:07:03.946
Luar biasa.

1574
02:07:03.947 --> 02:07:06.278
Desain tangki pembiakan Rocky.

1575
02:07:06.279 --> 02:07:07.818
Kerja bagus, Rock.

1576
02:07:07.819 --> 02:07:10.281
Kita bisa pulang.

1577
02:07:12.087 --> 02:07:13.658
Kita bisa pulang.

1578
